# Swingshot anywhere, one in each hand (Akimbo; QUEST_VR_OPTIONS="swing_anywhere 1", QUEST_SIM_GIVE=12
# QUEST_SIM_HOLD=12 QUEST_SIM_LEFT=12, at Kerwan's start, a tunnel): the tester's chain. The left trigger, the hands
# 40 degrees up at the arch: a swing (0x2C) by the left hand; let go on the forward swing, rising (about 50 ticks in),
# the fall after it (0x2D); the right trigger at once, the hands 10 degrees down: a pull (0x24, 0x25) by the right hand
# to the floor ahead, out of the fall, and its end. (0.1.13's first try let go at the swing's back end, landed, and
# its 5 degrees down found no floor within 30 units.)
600 y 1
606 y 0
3000 shot before
3100 hand_pitch 40
3150 left_trigger 1
3180 shot swing-1
3200 left_trigger 0
3203 hand_pitch -10
3206 shot let-go
3212 right_trigger 1
3240 shot pull-1
3280 shot pull-2
3400 right_trigger 0
3500 shot after
3600 quit 0
